      "name": "Flight Marathon Navigation 1",
      "content": "Drone Relief UAV 01 performs a marathon flight. Take off to 23 meters, fly to start point (101, 136, 23), then navigate through 10 waypoints: (205, 127, 23), (331, 272, 23), (405, 353, 23), (549, 475, 23), (645, 571, 23), (771, 630, 23), (870, 797, 23), (987, 823, 23), (891, 133, 23), (172, 804, 23). Avoid obstacles S01 Fragmented civil building 18, S01 Isolated obstruction 06. Finally, fly to end point (553, 555, 23) and land.",
