        "Command Relief UAV 01 on a marathon route: take off to 23m, start at (101,136,23), then clear WP1 (205,127,23), WP2 (331,272,23), WP3 (405,353,23), WP4 (549,475,23), WP5 (645,571,23), WP6 (771,630,23), WP7 (870,797,23), WP8 (987,823,23), WP9 (891,133,23), WP10 (172,804,23), avoid S01 Fragmented civil building 18 and S01 Isolated obstruction 06, finish at (553,555,23), and land.",
        "Relief UAV 01 endurance navigation: lift to 23 meters, begin at (101,136,23), fly sequentially through (205,127,23), (331,272,23), (405,353,23), (549,475,23), (645,571,23), (771,630,23), (870,797,23), (987,823,23), (891,133,23), (172,804,23), route around S01 Fragmented civil building 18 and S01 Isolated obstruction 06, then reach (553,555,23) and land."
