    {
      "id": "1939be29",
      "name": "Fleet Coordinated Takeoff and Formation (4 Drones) 1",
      "content": "Four-drone coordination exercise: Relief UAV 07, Relief UAV 04, Relief UAV 10, and Relief UAV 01 take off together to 22 meters altitude, then hold formation at positions (439, 513, 22), (648, 374, 22), (675, 563, 22), and (441, 637, 22) respectively for synchronized operation. Then all four drones move north for 102m, and next move east for 74m. Each drone must complete the specified directional movements (north 102m, then east 74m) regardless of starting position - if obstacles block the path, drones should adjust position as needed to complete the full directed distance in each heading.",
      "content_aliases": [
        "Coordinate Relief UAV 07, Relief UAV 04, Relief UAV 10, and Relief UAV 01: ascend together to 22 meters, establish square formation at positions (439, 513, 22), (648, 374, 22), (675, 563, 22), and (441, 637, 22) respectively, then execute coordinated movement north 102m followed by east 74m. All drones must complete the full directional distance (north 102m, east 74m) from their respective positions, adjusting as needed to avoid obstacles.",
        "Four-drone formation drill: launch Relief UAV 07, Relief UAV 04, Relief UAV 10, and Relief UAV 01 to altitude 22m, hold stations at (439, 513, 22), (648, 374, 22), (675, 563, 22), and (441, 637, 22) respectively, then shift north by 102 meters and east by 74 meters in synchronized operation. Each drone travels the specified distance in each direction regardless of obstacles encountered.",
        "Execute synchronized operation with Relief UAV 07, Relief UAV 04, Relief UAV 10, Relief UAV 01: take off reaching 22 meters height, maintain formation at coordinates (439, 513, 22), (648, 374, 22), (675, 563, 22), and (441, 637, 22) respectively, then proceed north for 102m and subsequently east for 74m together, with each drone completing the full directed movements by repositioning around obstacles if necessary.",
        "Four-drone coordinated maneuver: Relief UAV 07, Relief UAV 04, Relief UAV 10, and Relief UAV 01 lift off to 22m elevation, hold formation positions at (439, 513, 22), (648, 374, 22), (675, 563, 22), and (441, 637, 22) respectively, then travel north 102 meters and east 74 meters in sequence. The specified directional distances must be achieved by each drone, adapting position to circumvent any obstacles."
      ],
