    {
      "id": "db2a8775",
      "name": "Fleet Target Sweep (4 Drones) 1",
      "content": "Four-drone target sweep: Relief UAV 07, Relief UAV 10, Relief UAV 01, and Relief UAV 02 take off together to 18 meters altitude. Relief UAV 07 flies to target Temporary shelter assessment 09, Relief UAV 10 flies to target Civilian Damage Survey 2, Relief UAV 01 flies to target Relief Rendezvous 2, and Relief UAV 02 flies to target Shelter access assessment 02. After reaching the targets, all four drones move west for 74m, then south for 66m, then north for 84m together. Each drone must complete the specified directional movements (west 74m, south 66m, north 84m) regardless of starting position - if obstacles block the path, drones should adjust position as needed to complete the full directed distance in each heading.",
      "content_aliases": [
        "Coordinate Relief UAV 07, Relief UAV 10, Relief UAV 01, and Relief UAV 02: ascend together to 18 meters altitude, send Relief UAV 07 to target Temporary shelter assessment 09, Relief UAV 10 to target Civilian Damage Survey 2, Relief UAV 01 to target Relief Rendezvous 2, and Relief UAV 02 to target Shelter access assessment 02, then execute coordinated sweep movement west 74m, south 66m, and north 84m. All drones must complete the full directional distance (west 74m, south 66m, north 84m) from their respective positions, adjusting as needed to avoid obstacles.",
        "Four-drone target sweep operation: launch Relief UAV 07, Relief UAV 10, Relief UAV 01, and Relief UAV 02 to altitude 18m, navigate to targets Temporary shelter assessment 09, Civilian Damage Survey 2, Relief Rendezvous 2, Shelter access assessment 02 respectively, then shift west by 74 meters, south by 66 meters, and north by 84 meters in synchronized operation. Each drone travels the specified distance in each direction regardless of obstacles encountered.",
        "Execute four-drone sweep mission: Relief UAV 07, Relief UAV 10, Relief UAV 01, Relief UAV 02 take off reaching 18 meters height, fly to targets Temporary shelter assessment 09, Civilian Damage Survey 2, Relief Rendezvous 2, Shelter access assessment 02 respectively, then proceed west for 74m, subsequently south for 66m, and finally north for 84m together, with each drone completing the full directed movements by repositioning around obstacles if necessary.",
        "Four-drone coordinated target mission: Relief UAV 07, Relief UAV 10, Relief UAV 01, and Relief UAV 02 lift off to 18m elevation, reach targets Temporary shelter assessment 09, Civilian Damage Survey 2, Relief Rendezvous 2, Shelter access assessment 02 respectively, then travel west 74 meters, south 66 meters, and north 84 meters in sequence. The specified directional distances must be achieved by each drone, adapting position to circumvent any obstacles."
      ],
